  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LIFE - Lobbying for Integrity, Freedom, Equality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen fundamental human rights while combating hate speech and disinformation in Albania.  Narratives that aim to polarize society, erode trust in institutions and democracy, and the dialogue among different communities regularly target/use as scapegoats vulnerable communities like women, Roma, people with disabilities, LGBTIQ+, people of faith, refugees, and others. 
They impact democracy and the rule of law, the functioning of independent institutions , the safety and well-being of human rights defenders and vulnerable communities, the professionalism and freedom of media and journalists, and Albania&apos;s national security and interests.

This project will contribute to Albania&apos;s EU accession process by contributing to strengthening of democratic institutions, advocating for legal and policy changes, increasing the media and political literacy, empower vulnerable communities and human rights defenders by strengthening ties with decision-makers and the media.</narrative>
  </description>
